## Types

### Note

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `String` | primary |  |
| `grade` | `Grade` | required | Multi-line doc:<br>line two with a \| pipe. |
| `status` | `Enum["on\|off", "idle"]` |  |  |
| `code` | `String` |  | Alt spelling uses a\\\|b. |

